{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/1528","id":1475779486,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz885X9pue","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1528","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1528.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1528.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1528","number":1528,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Enhancement: Enable Account Switching for Non-Ephemeral Devices on Logout","user":{"login":"vsychov","id":2186303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxODYzMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2186303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov","html_url":"https://github.com/vsychov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vsychov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hello! I find myself saying this in almost every PR or ticket, but I'd like to take a moment to thank you once again for this fantastic product. I truly hope to see it thrive and evolve over time.\r\n\r\nThis PR addresses a user story and resolves a bug. Fixes: #1522 and #1310.\r\n\r\n**User Story:**\r\nAs a user, I want the ability to switch between accounts that I'm logged into, either via OIDC or through an auth-key.\r\n\r\n**Existing Issues:**\r\n- When logging in via OIDC as User A, then logging out and trying to log in as User B, there's a web interface error stating `could not register machine`.\r\n- If you log in using the auth-key for User A, log out, and then try to authenticate with the auth-key for User B, the authentication seems to work. However, you remain logged in as User A.\r\n\r\nThese scenarios are works for non-ephemeral devices. Ephemeral devices don't face this problem as they get removed upon logout. While these issues might be addressed in #1492, it got me thinking: Why not always remove devices on logout? What value do they have post-logout?\r\n\r\nHence, I'm suggesting this as either a temporary or permanent fix for the aforementioned issues.\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2023-08-15T11:54:50Z","updated_at":"2023-10-09T13:09:04Z","closed_at":"2023-09-24T21:01:58Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"251bb73a27aae403445ab40118e8e397e3c473cc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":